fonts-geist (Geist font families)

Geist is an open-source font family created by Vercel in collaboration
with Basement Studio and Andrés Briganti. This package includes the
Geist Sans, Geist Mono, Geist Pixel, and Geist Serif families in
OpenType and TrueType formats.

The font software is distributed under the SIL Open Font License,
Version 1.1. See OFL.txt in the package documentation for the complete
license text.

After installing the package, applications using fontconfig should find
the fonts automatically. Restart applications that were already running
before installation.
